FluidSur KDE
============

FluidSur Project
  Branding, KDE Plasma integration, Chinese localization, custom power applet,
  sensor face, packaging, and subsequent modifications.

Third-party contributors
------------------------

WhiteSur KDE and related artwork
  Vince Liuice (https://github.com/vinceliuice)

WhiteSur Icon Theme base artwork
  Vince Liuice (https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme)

KDE Plasma components used as adaptation bases
  KDE contributors listed in the individual component metadata and source files.

Capitaine/WhiteSur cursor artwork
  Original contributors listed by the bundled cursor project's license and
  original project records.
